> # R38ET Level 8: Fundamental Human Invariants & Ecological Ceiling
>
> Unalterable constitutional boundary conditions (Lex Superior / Kate Raworth DEAL Social Foundation).
> Notice: This specification serves as an architectural proposal and template for Level 8.
> Subordinate norms must satisfy these invariants fail-closed.

```catala
declaration structure Person:
  data is_sovereign: boolean
  data bodily_integrity_protected: boolean
  data water_access_guaranteed: boolean
  data food_access_guaranteed: boolean
  data housing_guaranteed: boolean
  data energy_access_guaranteed: boolean
  data healthcare_access_guaranteed: boolean
  data education_access_guaranteed: boolean
  data gender_equality_respected: boolean
  data social_equity_respected: boolean
  data political_voice_guaranteed: boolean
  data peace_and_justice_protected: boolean
  data network_connectivity_guaranteed: boolean

declaration scope HumanRightsInvariant:
  input person: Person
  output allowed: boolean

scope HumanRightsInvariant:
  definition allowed equals
    person.is_sovereign and
    person.bodily_integrity_protected and
    person.water_access_guaranteed and
    person.food_access_guaranteed and
    person.housing_guaranteed and
    person.energy_access_guaranteed and
    person.healthcare_access_guaranteed and
    person.education_access_guaranteed and
    person.gender_equality_respected and
    person.social_equity_respected and
    person.political_voice_guaranteed and
    person.peace_and_justice_protected and
    person.network_connectivity_guaranteed
```
